<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">LEGAL</span><h1>Terms & <em>conditions.</em></h1><p>Clear expectations for a smooth appointment.</p></div></section><section class="section legal"><div class="container narrow"><h2>Appointments</h2><p>Appointments are subject to availability. A booking is confirmed when the website successfully creates a booking reference. Please arrive a few minutes early so your service can begin on time.</p><h2>Changes and cancellations</h2><p>If you need to change or cancel an appointment, please contact the studio as soon as possible. Repeated late cancellations or no-shows may affect future booking availability.</p><h2>Services and pricing</h2><p>Services and displayed prices are subject to change. The price shown when you make your booking is the reference price for that appointment.</p><h2>Customer information</h2><p>Information supplied through the booking form is used to manage your appointment and communicate booking-related information. Please provide accurate contact details.</p><h2>Calendar links</h2><p>Calendar files and Google Calendar links are generated from the appointment selected during booking. Calendar availability and syncing are controlled by your calendar provider.</p><h2>Website use</h2><p>This fictional website is a demonstration project. Content, contact details, pricing and location are illustrative and should not be treated as details of a real operating business.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about an appointment can be directed to hello@gentlemanscode.co.za or +27 21 123 4567.</p></div></section>
